GPT-QModel MobileLLM port

This directory is an independent Apache-2.0 implementation of the MobileLLM
architecture (Meta's "MobileLLM: Optimizing Sub-billion Parameter Language
Models for On-Device Use Cases", Liu et al., ICML 2024). It was written in a
clean room from a behavioral specification, without access to the original
MobileLLM source code, and contains no code from that release.

It is compatible with the configuration and state_dict format of the
published MobileLLM checkpoints (module and tensor names are interface facts
kept for checkpoint compatibility). Standard Llama-family building blocks are
reused from GPT-QModel's vendored Apache-2.0 Transformers v5.23.0 Llama port
(gptqmodel/models/ports/native/llama).

